1475
01:28:25,957 --> 01:28:30,870
Celebrities are cheered on for bashing women and the same old misogyny is being dressed up as.

1476
01:28:30,950 --> 01:28:31,847
step as a joke.

1477
01:28:31,927 --> 01:28:36,045
And the sad part is people are laughing instead of reflecting.

1478
01:28:36,125 --> 01:28:38,585
I don't want to be worshiped or pitied.

1479
01:28:38,665 --> 01:28:40,633
I just want to be understood.

1480
01:28:40,713 --> 01:28:48,402
I want to know if it's too much to ask for a relationship that's built on partnership instead of servitude.

1481
01:28:48,482 --> 01:28:52,730
With love, respect and a heavy heart, A B C, Nuremberg, Germany.

1482
01:28:52,810 --> 01:28:57,860
So as you saw, this email has come from Germany from a girl for whom the biggest

1483
01:28:57,940 --> 01:29:06,180
The biggest deal breaker is the one who says that he won't be comfortable living with the parents.

1484
