First of all, there is no such thing as a joint family system in Islam.

1486
01:29:14,340 --> 01:29:20,980
Because there is an understanding that where there are more people, there will be more problems.

1487
01:29:21,060 --> 01:29:23,060
You know the drill.

1488
01:29:24,900 --> 01:29:26,820
He will look at his mother.

1489
01:29:26,900 --> 01:29:34,260
A tennis referee will look at his mother or wife and he will want to keep both of them happy.

1490
01:29:34,340 --> 01:29:38,980
And in that pursuit, both of them will not be happy and he will get so exhausted.

1491
01:29:39,060 --> 01:29:45,660
Anyway, there's nothing wrong in demanding and knowing what you want.

1492
01:29:45,740 --> 01:29:50,260
We have the same thing, arrogance is understood.

1493
01:29:50,980 --> 01:29:56,900
