But I was saying in the last video that in our society, misbehaving is considered arrogant.

1495
01:30:01,980 --> 01:30:04,900
This is what I was saying yesterday when we were talking about the kids.

1496
01:30:04,980 --> 01:30:10,900
And independence is not indifference. Independence is something that I want to live by my own rules.

1497
01:30:10,980 --> 01:30:18,800
If a person stays in his house as a service staff, yesterday I saw a reel.

1498
01:30:19,360 --> 01:30:28,747
There are internalized misogyny ladies, that women don't work like a maid at home,

1499
