1510
01:31:13,020 --> 01:31:17,140
Think about it, what is this thing that his maid is outside and his maid is at home?

1511
01:31:17,220 --> 01:31:21,658
So this is the thing that people tell upfront that this is a deal breaker for me,

1512
01:31:21,738 --> 01:31:26,359
it's okay, we didn't talk about it till the second date, but what they say, we'll see,

1513
01:31:26,439 --> 01:31:29,540
it will happen, it never happens, it comes to you.

1514
01:31:29,620 --> 01:31:32,786
And then because everything is on the woman,

1515
01:31:32,866 --> 01:31:38,699
the woman is the protector of respect and the woman is the one who has all the pressure,

1516
01:31:38,779 --> 01:31:40,050
then it will come to you.

1517
01:31:40,130 --> 01:31:42,050
Then you will become the home breaker.

1518
