1543
01:33:07,610 --> 01:33:11,530
It's a very, I mean it's not a big thing, but it's a big thing here.

1544
01:33:11,610 --> 01:33:19,530
I think, personally, that in our country, women are very observant of their surroundings.

1545
01:33:19,610 --> 01:33:24,530
So they saw their mother traveling and they said that they will break this cycle here.

1546
