1557
01:34:13,030 --> 01:34:17,950
Men on the other hand, they are catching up but not as equally fast-paced.

1558
01:34:18,030 --> 01:34:23,910
So I think that in the age of awareness, a whole generation will have to make sacrifices.

1559
01:34:24,480 --> 01:34:24,780
Right?

1560
01:34:24,860 --> 01:34:28,748
Women who are standing up for themselves, who have enough self-esteem,

1561
01:34:28,828 --> 01:34:32,080
