So if your story goes to such a place and especially in a place like Dubai where there is multiculturalism and where things are better.

3403
03:33:14,900 --> 03:33:17,680
So I think you still have a good shot.

3404
03:33:17,760 --> 03:33:18,500
with that.

3405
03:33:18,580 --> 03:33:24,060
Rest, there is PTSD, trauma, I understand.

3406
03:33:24,140 --> 03:33:25,720
And as you said, pain.

3407
03:33:25,800 --> 03:33:27,720
There is no hand, but there is still pain in the hand.

3408
03:33:27,800 --> 03:33:33,520
Because your brain had gone through that pain for so long,

3409
03:33:33,600 --> 03:33:36,280
that it still believed that it is still there.

3410
03:33:36,360 --> 03:33:41,900
And that is something really, really serious.

3411
03:33:41,980 --> 03:33:43,510
Rest, if you ever feel darkness.

3412
03:33:43,590 --> 03:33:45,447
If ever life feels heavy again,

3413
03:33:45,527 --> 03:33:52,670
perhaps maybe consult a therapist if that is something up your alley and that is something you're open to.

3414
03:33:52,750 --> 03:33:59,070
Because it helps, you know, getting a perspective, a non-judgmental perspective.

3415
03:33:59,150 --> 03:34:04,350
And there's nothing wrong with what happened to you as in there's nothing you can do about it.

3416
03:34:10,380 --> 03:34:14,661
You have nothing to do with it.

3417
03:34:14,741 --> 03:34:21,100
You were just riding a bus and it just so happened.

3418
03:34:21,180 --> 03:34:23,316
We can't control certain things.

3419
03:34:23,396 --> 03:34:29,100
We can control how we react to it and how we try to live our lives with that thing.

3420
03:34:29,180 --> 03:34:37,180
So I hope spiritually you're connected because that is also something that makes a person very meaningful.

3421
03:34:37,560 --> 03:34:41,480
You get meaning by praying and talking to Allah.

3422
03:34:41,560 --> 03:34:46,480
And it really helps you. It grounds you.

3423
03:34:46,560 --> 03:34:50,480
And I think you should also be thankful for being alive.

3424
03:34:50,560 --> 03:34:56,480
I mean, in a country like Pakistan, where there is so much negligence in surgeries,

3425
03:34:56,560 --> 03:35:01,480
you have spent three years in the hospital.

3426
03:35:01,560 --> 03:35:04,350
This is also a big thing.

3427
03:35:04,430 --> 03:35:08,870
And of course, Allah had better plans for you. Allah had, Allah wanted more from you.

3428
03:35:08,950 --> 03:35:12,870
Otherwise, what were the odds of you surviving this?

3429
03:35:12,950 --> 03:35:17,110
And you're proving yourself far more than before.

3430
03:35:17,190 --> 03:35:19,352
So you had it in you.

3431
03:35:19,432 --> 03:35:23,248
Sometimes it takes, it ha, sometimes the pain has to,

3432
03:35:23,328 --> 03:35:28,500
one has to endure the pain in order to rediscover themselves.

3433
03:35:28,950 --> 03:35:32,570
You may not work as aggressively as you used to.

3434
03:35:32,650 --> 03:35:33,719
the way you do now.

3435
03:35:33,799 --> 03:35:34,099
Right?

3436
03:35:34,179 --> 03:35:37,500
Because a person has to prove himself.

3437
03:35:37,580 --> 03:35:41,484
And that self satisfaction is the best satisfaction.

3438
03:35:41,564 --> 03:35:43,439
So you're driven by it as well.

3439
03:35:43,519 --> 03:35:45,756
So sometimes you have to endure pain.

3440
03:35:45,836 --> 03:35:49,484
So there's some emotional pain, there's some familial pain.

3441
03:35:49,564 --> 03:35:53,924
This is literally a physical pain and not one trumps the other.

3442
03:35:54,004 --> 03:35:57,997
But what matters most is how you come out of it.

3443
03:35:58,077 --> 03:35:59,327
And you've done great.

3444
03:35:59,407 --> 03:35:59,707
I mean

3445
03:35:59,787 --> 03:36:01,690
I mean, okay, you're struggling with work.

3446
03:36:01,770 --> 03:36:05,690
Yeah, I don't know. Hiccups are in life. It's just some speed breakers.

3447
03:36:05,770 --> 03:36:11,050
You already have it in you. You have organic followers. Perhaps continue your content journey.

3448
03:36:11,130 --> 03:36:16,890
That would give you more meaning and even if it doesn't, make a showreel, make a portfolio.

3449
03:36:16,970 --> 03:36:21,690
Get more active on LinkedIn. I think your story needs to go out.

3450
03:36:21,770 --> 03:36:26,730
And since you're creating, nobody can tell you a story better than yourself. So.

3451
03:36:27,220 --> 03:36:32,340
If you can visualize it really well, I think that would reach far and wide.

3452
03:36:32,420 --> 03:36:34,420
And everybody loves a good story.

3453
03:36:35,220 --> 03:36:40,620
And you never know which doors can open from there.

3454
03:36:41,620 --> 03:36:47,540
Rest, you don't need to start over. You already did multiple times.

3455
03:36:47,620 --> 03:36:53,370
And what do you need to focus on? You build something that makes people come out to you rather than you going out.

3456
03:36:53,450 --> 03:37:00,370
And lastly, once again, I'll say that don't write about your disability when you're applying.

3457
03:37:00,450 --> 03:37:05,370
You're not hiding anything. It's just that they said that you're sending talent.

3458
03:37:05,450 --> 03:37:10,370
They didn't ask you about two hands, two eyes, two legs. You're not hiding anything from them.

3459
03:37:10,450 --> 03:37:17,370
When you go, you'll see it. Now they said that work comes, you said yes.

3460
03:37:17,450 --> 03:37:20,380
Send a portfolio, hold this portfolio.

3461
03:37:20,930 --> 03:37:22,350
You're not hiding anything.

3462
03:37:22,430 --> 03:37:24,350
You're not concealing anything.

3463
03:37:24,430 --> 03:37:26,850
Okay? So when you go,

3464
03:37:26,930 --> 03:37:28,350
you'll see.

3465
03:37:28,430 --> 03:37:30,850
They'll be concerned about max-to-max turnaround time.

3466
03:37:30,930 --> 03:37:34,350
That, if a two-handed person can do something fast, how can you do it?

3467
03:37:34,430 --> 03:37:36,850
So you tell them. Tell them, give me a test right now, I'll make it for you.

3468
03:37:36,930 --> 03:37:39,850
In front of them. So when they see that, okay, his speed is good.

3469
03:37:39,930 --> 03:37:44,850
And he made this poster and cut the reel and gave it to me. So that's fine.

3470
03:37:44,930 --> 03:37:46,930
So let the situation come to that.

3471
03:37:47,930 --> 03:37:50,130
If you go to the function, they'll never call you.

3472
03:37:50,210 --> 03:37:54,530
And HR is also going according to the time.

3473
03:37:54,610 --> 03:37:57,930
They have to interview people at the minimum time.

3474
03:37:58,010 --> 03:37:59,450
Or process them.

3475
03:37:59,530 --> 03:38:02,450
So don't deselect yourself.

3476
03:38:02,530 --> 03:38:04,450
Just go to the interview table.

3477
03:38:04,530 --> 03:38:06,450
And God willing, something good will come out.

3478
03:38:06,530 --> 03:38:08,450
Take care and lots of prayers for you.

3479
03:38:08,530 --> 03:38:11,530
And thank you for sharing your story. It means a lot. Thank you so much.

3480
03:38:14,840 --> 03:38:16,040
We're already on Friday.

3481
03:38:16,120 --> 03:38:18,040
Saturday will be released.

3482
03:38:18,120 --> 03:38:22,040
I said in the beginning that I will tell you something, but I haven't told you yet.

3483
03:38:22,120 --> 03:38:27,040
I have been planning on doing some sort of a live event with regards to the Q&A.

3484
03:38:27,120 --> 03:38:31,040
But we're still trying to figure out the format.

3485
03:38:31,120 --> 03:38:35,040
It has to be an entertaining one, but not like.

3486
03:38:35,120 --> 03:38:39,040
May God have mercy.

3487
03:38:39,120 --> 03:38:42,270
So we're just brainstorming on that.

3488
03:38:42,350 --> 03:38:45,870
So whatever there is, it will be on my Instagram very, very soon.

3489
03:38:45,950 --> 03:38:51,550
But the idea is, so like let's say there's a show, so I am, there are two more comedians.

3490
03:38:52,030 --> 03:38:55,851
And then the people who are coming with tickets, if they want,

3491
03:38:55,931 --> 03:38:59,430
they can hand us the printout of their questions.

3492
03:39:00,150 --> 03:39:03,590
Primarily fun incidents, right?

3493
03:39:03,950 --> 03:39:08,950
And then we get to discuss that on stage and maybe, you know, include the.

3494
03:39:09,980 --> 03:39:16,060
the guy who or the girl who handed over the question and just have a little bit of banter.

3495
03:39:16,940 --> 03:39:19,906
So something along those lines.

3496
03:39:19,986 --> 03:39:22,073
I was speaking for example,

3497
03:39:22,153 --> 03:39:29,660
what if I went to a venue and five people for whatever reason they just decide not to.

3498
03:39:29,740 --> 03:39:35,740
We can't fake any emails. It has to be genuine emails. So yeah, not a therapeutic session. It has to be genuine emails.

3499
03:39:37,930 --> 03:39:39,850
It has to be an entertaining session. Right?

3500
03:39:39,930 --> 03:39:43,350
So be mindful of that. Sometimes you get weird questions.

3501
03:39:43,430 --> 03:39:45,350
So come and ask them.

3502
03:39:45,430 --> 03:39:48,850
Even if you don't come in front, if you want to keep anonymity, we'll ask on stage.

3503
03:39:48,930 --> 03:39:53,850
Because this question is from this guy. Do you want to reveal yourself? If you choose not to, that's perfectly fine.

3504
03:39:53,930 --> 03:39:56,930
And then we'll just, it'll be a one way conversation.

3505
03:39:57,640 --> 03:39:59,665
If you want to be part of it, then yeah.

3506
03:39:59,745 --> 03:40:02,439
Something along those lines.

3507
03:40:02,519 --> 03:40:04,930
Let's see how things transpire.

3508
03:40:05,710 --> 03:40:10,990
Alright, last email. One tired bomb, one long email and a lot of feelings.

3509
03:40:11,320 --> 03:40:12,632
Hi, Junaid bhai.

3510
03:40:12,712 --> 03:40:15,337
I hope this email finds you well.

3511
03:40:15,417 --> 03:40:24,230
My name is A B C and she is someone who's married and someone who's working in one of the sectors.

3512
03:40:24,310 --> 03:40:29,550
They have said that no detail should be known. Okay. Aspiring to do more every day.

3513
03:40:29,630 --> 03:40:32,530
I've been a loyal listener of your Ask Ganjee Sohaq series for a long time.

3514
03:40:32,610 --> 03:40:36,350
But since I had my beautiful baby girl, I've missed quite a few episodes.

3515
03:40:36,430 --> 03:40:38,584
Recently, as I've returned to work,

3516
03:40:38,664 --> 03:40:42,382
I've been binge watching the series to catch up on everything I missed.

3517
03:40:42,462 --> 03:40:44,460
Since I've been listening back to back,

3518
03:40:44,540 --> 03:40:47,438
I've noticed the ups and downs in your energy and mood,

3519
03:40:47,518 --> 03:40:49,875
sending you lots of positivity and duas truly.

3520
03:40:49,955 --> 03:40:55,369
This is going to be a long email and I apologize in advance for taking so much of your time,

3521
03:40:55,449 --> 03:41:00,100
but I needed a place to vent and share something that has been weighing on me for a while.

3522
03:41:00,180 --> 03:41:05,885
First of all, never apologize for a long email because the more context there is,

3523
03:41:05,965 --> 03:41:08,260
the more understanding there will be.

3524
03:41:08,340 --> 03:41:08,640
Okay?

3525
03:41:08,720 --> 03:41:10,080
So that's important.

3526
03:41:10,160 --> 03:41:10,926
No problem.

3527
03:41:11,006 --> 03:41:11,692
Background.

3528
03:41:11,772 --> 03:41:15,890
The last many years of my life have been a roller coaster.

3529
03:41:15,970 --> 03:41:23,093
My seemingly educated parents married me off to a guy in another country when I was just twenty.

3530
03:41:23,173 --> 03:41:23,473
Okay?

3531
03:41:23,553 --> 03:41:25,620
And they barely knew the guy.

3532
03:41:25,960 --> 03:41:31,880
Despite big dreams and ambitions, I was working two jobs and attending weekend exclusive classes for my bachelor's degree.

3533
03:41:31,960 --> 03:41:35,880
Good yaar, two jobs and weekend executive classes. Bahi commitment hai.

3534
03:41:35,960 --> 03:41:42,880
I was promised that I could continue working and studying after marriage, but the star-plus drama that followed was on another level.

3535
03:41:42,960 --> 03:41:46,880
I've never been one for unnecessary drama, so I tried to keep my distance from it.

3536
03:41:46,960 --> 03:41:52,960
But to keep the pace, I ended up giving up on a million dreams and slowly my social life as well.

3537
03:41:53,840 --> 03:41:55,054
After years of struggle,

3538
03:41:55,134 --> 03:42:01,060
we finally moved out and for the first time I started feeling independent again when I began working.

3539
03:42:01,140 --> 03:42:04,865
My husband has apparently been very supportive of everything I do,

3540
03:42:04,945 --> 03:42:07,927
except that somehow I end up doing everything his way.

3541
03:42:08,007 --> 03:42:09,980
But that's a story for another day.

3542
03:42:10,060 --> 03:42:12,980
What is the life of a woman? She asks.

3543
03:42:13,060 --> 03:42:18,480
The thing that's been bothering me lately is this. What is a woman's life really supposed to be?

3544
03:42:18,560 --> 03:42:21,060
I've been asked about when I'm having kids.

3545
03:42:21,190 --> 03:42:22,654
since the day I got married.

3546
03:42:22,734 --> 03:42:25,491
Not just by my in-laws, but my own family as well.

3547
03:42:25,571 --> 03:42:27,555
And the day I actually became a mom,

3548
03:42:27,635 --> 03:42:31,630
those questions turned into constant judgment about my parenting style.

3549
03:42:31,710 --> 03:42:37,297
I always knew I didn't want kids until I was clear on my own values and how I wanted to raise them.

3550
03:42:37,377 --> 03:42:39,512
Despite immense pressure from my husband,

3551
03:42:39,592 --> 03:42:43,321
raising a child isn't just about feeding and changing diapers.

3552
03:42:43,401 --> 03:42:48,380
It's about discipline, values, emotional safety, and shaping a little human being.

3553
03:42:48,460 --> 03:42:51,740
every reaction and every word becomes their inner voice.

3554
03:42:51,820 --> 03:42:57,260
I've done thorough research on child development and learned so much through experience.

3555
03:42:57,340 --> 03:43:03,020
I'm not saying the advice my family and friends give is relevant, but I didn't ask for it.

3556
03:43:03,100 --> 03:43:08,780
Every child is different. And thirdly, my parenting style can be different from yours, and that's okay.

3557
03:43:09,660 --> 03:43:16,070
The issue, if they see me being attentive to my daughter, I'm labeled as a helicopter parent. If I enforce.

3558
03:43:16,150 --> 03:43:20,650
No screen policy because I want her to spend quality time with us. I hear.

3559
03:43:20,730 --> 03:43:25,550
She is getting bored. You don't care. If I sleep train her, I am told.

3560
03:43:25,630 --> 03:43:25,930
She is being cruel.

3561
03:43:26,010 --> 03:43:27,630
You are doing injustice, not loving.

3562
03:43:30,230 --> 03:43:35,090
laws, it's coming from my own family. When I shut them out, I'm seen as a bad person.

3563
03:43:35,170 --> 03:43:37,170
where I needed support, I got questioned.

3564
03:43:37,417 --> 03:43:40,734
If I encourage her independence, I'm called a selfish mom.

3565
03:43:40,814 --> 03:43:41,862
Then there's daycare.

3566
03:43:41,942 --> 03:43:43,320
She started going to the hospital.

3567
03:43:43,780 --> 03:43:49,180
started going when I resumed work and the things I've heard about it, it's so overwhelming.

3568
03:43:49,260 --> 03:43:57,900
Even without anyone's opinion, sending her to daycare after a while, once she was born,

3569
03:43:57,980 --> 03:43:59,763
and her is already hard on me.

3570
03:43:59,843 --> 03:44:01,209
My mind races all day.

3571
03:44:01,289 --> 03:44:01,954
Did she eat?

3572
03:44:02,034 --> 03:44:02,904
Did she sleep?

3573
03:44:02,984 --> 03:44:03,711
Did she poop?

3574
03:44:03,791 --> 03:44:05,361
Is the temperature okay?

3575
03:44:05,441 --> 03:44:07,162
Was the formula out too long?

3576
03:44:07,242 --> 03:44:08,795
She hasn't had an update.

3577
03:44:08,875 --> 03:44:09,620
Is she okay?

3578
03:44:10,200 --> 03:44:15,219
I also worry about missing small meaningful moments, saying Bismillah before her meals,

3579
03:44:15,299 --> 03:44:19,830
teaching her values, because she now spends 50% of her awake time at daycare.

3580
03:44:20,460 --> 03:44:22,875
And honestly, ever since I've resumed work,

3581
03:44:22,955 --> 03:44:25,875
there's just this constant data overload in my head.

3582
03:44:25,955 --> 03:44:30,920
It feels like my brain's trying to open 20 tabs at once and none of them want to close.

3583
03:44:31,000 --> 03:44:38,000
Financially, we can't manage on one income. Emotionally, I'd go crazy staying home all day. So I work.

3584
03:44:38,110 --> 03:44:40,004
but the mental overload is real.

3585
03:44:40,084 --> 03:44:44,483
After work, I get only a few hours with my baby as the default parent.

3586
03:44:44,563 --> 03:44:46,846
I feed her, bathe her, play with her,

3587
03:44:46,926 --> 03:44:51,202
and then because my husband never learned basic chores as mom's son,

3588
03:44:51,282 --> 03:44:52,824
I cook and clean as well.

3589
03:44:52,904 --> 03:44:54,912
Every time my in-laws visit,

3590
03:44:54,992 --> 03:45:00,756
they make sure to point out what a cruel wife I am for committing the ultimate crime,

3591
03:45:00,836 --> 03:45:03,119
making my husband do his own laundry.

3592
03:45:03,199 --> 03:45:05,620
He helps in cleaning to be fair, but

3593
03:45:05,700 --> 03:45:08,309
But the load is still heavier on me.

3594
03:45:08,389 --> 03:45:14,095
Then comes preparing for the next day, packing lunches, washing and sterilizing bottles,

3595
03:45:14,175 --> 03:45:16,180
setting everything up again.

3596
03:45:16,260 --> 03:45:17,377
The breaking point.

3597
03:45:17,457 --> 03:45:21,462
I know it sounds like I'm complaining, but honestly, I'm not.

3598
03:45:21,542 --> 03:45:24,441
Alhamdulillah for my life and for my daughter.

3599
03:45:24,521 --> 03:45:29,267
I love her endlessly, but amidst all this, I just want to feel seen.

3600
03:45:29,347 --> 03:45:32,830
What flips me over the edge is when my husband expects

3601
03:45:33,010 --> 03:45:36,930
sex at the end of the day as if it's some sort of reward he's earned.

3602
03:45:37,010 --> 03:45:39,650
He, okay, I don't want to read this.

3603
03:45:39,730 --> 03:45:42,650
I listen to him, but in my head I want to punch him.

3604
03:45:42,730 --> 03:45:46,450
How am I supposed to feel romantic when I'm drowning in mental load?

3605
03:45:46,530 --> 03:45:47,526
I'm not ungrateful.

3606
03:45:47,606 --> 03:45:48,785
I appreciate the effort,

3607
03:45:48,865 --> 03:45:53,850
but imagine finding the dishwasher full of dirty dishes he forgot to start right before bed.

3608
03:45:53,930 --> 03:45:56,650
And then being expected to be in the mood.

3609
03:45:56,730 --> 03:46:00,410
Women are tired, deep bone fried, bone tired.

3610
03:46:00,620 --> 03:46:05,740
I don't know how other women do it. I feel like I'm slowly losing myself.

3611
03:46:05,820 --> 03:46:07,490
My family thinks I'm a bad person.

3612
03:46:07,570 --> 03:46:09,044
My husband thinks I'm selfish.

3613
03:46:09,124 --> 03:46:13,740
And one day my child might grow up and talk to a therapist about how I wasn't enough.

3614
03:46:13,820 --> 03:46:16,515
Despite me pouring every last drop myself into her.

3615
03:46:16,595 --> 03:46:19,132
I have no time or energy for friends or hobbies.

3616
03:46:19,212 --> 03:46:20,296
I used to be happy.

3617
03:46:21,301 --> 03:46:22,172
Now I feel better.

3618
03:46:22,252 --> 03:46:25,900
And I finally understand why so many Pakistani moms are like this.

3619
03:46:25,980 --> 03:46:27,340
Not because they don't care.

3620
03:46:27,420 --> 03:46:30,271
don't care but because they are exhausted.

3621
03:46:30,351 --> 03:46:31,416
Everything hurts.

3622
03:46:31,496 --> 03:46:33,376
Sorry for the long messy rant.

3623
03:46:33,456 --> 03:46:35,837
I just needed to let it out somewhere.

3624
03:46:35,917 --> 03:46:44,552
Time for me to grab whatever sleep I can before my baby wakes up for her night feed so I can wake up tomorrow to do all over it again.

3625
03:46:44,632 --> 03:46:46,073
Regards, our tired mom.

3626
03:46:46,153 --> 03:46:50,161
So, as you heard that there is a woman who is a new mom.

3627
03:46:50,241 --> 03:46:50,913
No, not new.

3628
03:46:50,993 --> 03:46:53,760
I mean, it's been a while but still dealing with

3629
03:46:53,840 --> 03:46:56,160
dealing with a toddler and a husband.

